-----------------------------------------------
README file for EdwardsNextTurbo Support Module
-----------------------------------------------

README last updated 06/08/2024

This module supports the Edwards nEXT series of Turbo pump controllers
which each control one Edwards Turbo pump.

Module was originally tested with EPICS R3.14.12.3 over RS232 against
Edwards nEXT Turbomolecular pump reporting:
Pump Model nEXT-P2 
Firmware   D39649602C
Bootloader D37479601C

It has been deployed on several beamline end stations over many years,
experiencing version dependency and EPIC base upgrades.
